  },
  {
   "i": 1192,
   "src": "9072bd4bf720",
   "t": "About that {{medalia}} detection {{app}}..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1207,
   "src": "e850bd6d35ce",
   "t": "What do you say"
  },
  {
   "i": 1210,
   "src": "7521e937c98a",
   "t": "we open it to the whole {{student}} body?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1225,
   "src": "7d574f6ea7be",
   "t": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1230,
   "src": "55af011d6889",
   "t": "Vice-Principal"
  },
  {
   "i": 1236,
   "src": "24dcd92b2ea5",
   "t": "If only you can use the detector,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1239,
   "src": "495df128bca4",
   "t": "you'll collect lots of {{medalia}} from now\non."
  },
  {
   "i": 1247,
   "src": "7a3e19f51252",
   "t": "In a school where {{medabot|pl}} are central"
  },
  {
   "i": 1250,
   "src": "8a1c57c6a858",
   "t": "to the curriculum, that's too big an\nedge."
  },
  {
   "i": 1258,
   "src": "f572ec98563f",
   "t": "Educationally speaking, that's a\nproblem."
  },
  {
   "i": 1261,
   "src": "87971a2e329b",
   "t": "It creates inequality, after all."
  },
  {
   "i": 1269,
   "src": "874ea1a7a568",
   "t": "But if we open it to everyone,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1272,
   "src": "389edce3605b",
   "t": "all can compete on equal ground by\neffort."
  },
  {
   "i": 1280,
   "src": "e850bd6d35ce",
   "t": "What do you think?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1283,
   "src": "45bde5677764",
   "t": "Would you consider it?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1303,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1311,
   "src": "4da25ee51f16",
   "t": "Sure, that's fine."
  },
  {
   "i": 1322,
   "src": "2f526da01f0e",
   "t": "President."
  },
  {
   "i": 1327,
   "src": "55af011d6889",
   "t": "Vice-Principal"
  },
  {
   "i": 1333,
   "src": "d2f01fc0e96a",
   "t": "O-oh, really?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1336,
   "src": "ccef63e0340b",
   "t": "I knew you'd say that."
  },
  {
   "i": 1351,
   "src": "ecb9683cddba",
   "t": "Thank you. Please start"
  },
  {
   "i": 1354,
   "src": "3338e356d360",
   "t": "preparing right away."
  },
  {
   "i": 1362,
